19|// One-shot entry intent: set just before pushing the previous scene
20|// route, so the new page opens on its last sub-page. Client memory only,
21|// never the URL, so prerendered pages stay static and a direct URL load
22|// always starts at page 0.
23|let enterAtEnd = false;
